                    <note type="editorial">
    
    Appears in the 1796 lists under 1795 and I propose that we code the two references to
    him that appear in this year:    
    
    •	1 -- dudley 
    o	1795-09-23 Dine at King's , w. Dudley, Bellamys, Kendillon &amp; Sinclair
    •	1 -- lord dudley 
    o	1795-03-29 call on Bosville ; adv. Robinson, mrs Beaumont &amp; lord Dudley
    
    Godwin corresponded with his son, John William, the next lord - and later earl - Dudley in the 1820s.
    
    JG    
  </note>
